Sval: let Sval supply search engines and their icons

The search service reads Sval's configuration from SvalSearchConfig instead of
Mozilla's remote one, and does not follow the remote collections' sync, which
would replace Sval's list with Mozilla's and add its overrides whenever a sync
reached them.

diff --git a/toolkit/components/search/ConfigSearchEngine.sys.mjs b/toolkit/components/search/ConfigSearchEngine.sys.mjs
